flowchart LR
    R["Inference request"] --> K["Cache key builder"]
    A["Authorization scope"] --> K
    T["Tenant/case scope"] --> K
    M["Model + tokenizer"] --> K
    P["Prompt/graph version"] --> K
    E["Evidence version"] --> K
    K --> H{"Complete exact binding?"}
    H -->|No| MISS["Fail closed: cache miss"]
    H -->|Yes| C["Tenant-isolated exact prefix cache"]
    C --> V["Validate TTL and invalidation epoch"]
    V -->|Valid| USE["Reuse prefill/KV work only"]
    V -->|Stale| MISS
    S["Semantic regulatory answer cache"] -. "prohibited" .-> MISS
    USE -. "does not confer authority or approval" .-> O["Normal inference and output validation"]
